(6878406, 1036672, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the pigeon ''rising'' above all the others that remain on the ground. I like how you captured the pigeon in flight to dominate the top right corner for I feel like he is about to fly out of the scene as he soars to greater heights. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great capture of the pigeon ''rising'' above all the others that remain on the ground. I like how you captured the pigeon in flight to dominate the top right corner for I feel like he is about to fly out of the scene as he soars to greater heights. Nicely done.', '2012-10-08 10:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6878417, 1036523, 43463, '<td valign="top">Heh, great visual to suit that portion of the lyric line.. Hmmm, the second half of the line mentions a gun and to announce the start of the race begins with the firing of a gun so it is a good fit there too. Love how you captured the runners about to bolt from the starting line - good action. The processing is also excellent. Well done.</td>', 'Heh, great visual to suit that portion of the lyric line.. Hmmm, the second half of the line mentions a gun and to announce the start of the race begins with the firing of a gun so it is a good fit there too. Love how you captured the runners about to bolt from the starting line - good action. The processing is also excellent. Well done.', '2012-10-08 10:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
