(6879027, 1036107, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Don''t see many working typewriters anymore. The photo is simple, clean and very effective in invoking the song. Nice light and details in the composition - well done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Don''t see many working typewriters anymore. The photo is simple, clean and very effective in invoking the song. Nice light and details in the composition - well done.', '2012-10-08 23:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6879035, 1036610, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Nice details and lighting on the rat. That said, it is a fair shot of this pet rat but it doesn''t really invoke the song in my head. I see someone taking great care of their pet but nothing that speaks that they are ''carrying'' a (great) weight (of their past) and/or not allowing someone to get close emotionally (given some of the lines in the song). The hands cradling the rat shows more of the emotion of love - so for me it just doesn''t capture the song title. My other critique is that I wish that the pose of the rat had something more that captured his/her character or emotion - such as standing on all fours, head &amp; nose extended to look lovingly at the off screen owner.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Nice details and lighting on the rat. That said, it is a fair shot of this pet rat but it doesn''t really invoke the song in my head. I see someone taking great care of their pet but nothing that speaks that they are ''carrying'' a (great) weight (of their past) and/or not allowing someone to get close emotionally (given some of the lines in the song). The hands cradling the rat shows more of the emotion of love - so for me it just doesn''t capture the song title. My other critique is that I wish that the pose of the rat had something more that captured his/her character or emotion - such as standing on all fours, head & nose extended to look lovingly at the off screen owner.', '2012-10-08 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
