(6879116, 1036170, 108580, '<td valign="top">Although seemingly pushed on the tone-mapping side, Joe Average speed voter will not notice that. Perfect challenge fit with a solid and appealing image with perfect photographic rules. The halos on the tree''s leaves are a dead over processing give away and must be better controlled in PP. I would vote at least a 7 without the halos and possibly an 8 for DMC fit. You will no doubt get a lot of 7''s for this shot and I trust a front page at least.</td>', 'Although seemingly pushed on the tone-mapping side, Joe Average speed voter will not notice that. Perfect challenge fit with a solid and appealing image with perfect photographic rules. The halos on the tree''s leaves are a dead over processing give away and must be better controlled in PP. I would vote at least a 7 without the halos and possibly an 8 for DMC fit. You will no doubt get a lot of 7''s for this shot and I trust a front page at least.', '2012-10-09 04:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
