(6880913, 1036588, 138630, '<td valign="top">My top pick - wonderful in every way.  This has the appearance of a candid but I cannot imagine a better "set-up" - the physical and apparent relational closeness of the two girls, the physical distance and apparent disconnect between them and the old man, his downcast gaze and the pose that could be just relaxed but seems somehow sad - everything works to suggest a story that is perfectly titled.  Lovely tones, too.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'My top pick - wonderful in every way.  This has the appearance of a candid but I cannot imagine a better "set-up" - the physical and apparent relational closeness of the two girls, the physical distance and apparent disconnect between them and the old man, his downcast gaze and the pose that could be just relaxed but seems somehow sad - everything works to suggest a story that is perfectly titled.  Lovely tones, too.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-11 10:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
