(6881188, 1036703, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2, tied with another.<br/>I was half expecting someone to do this with a shot from Marineland. I personally don''t think the photo is stellar, but the idea is what''s elevating big time. I chuckle quietly every time I scan through the thumb when I see this one, so it earned a better mark than the rest.</td>', '#2, tied with another.I was half expecting someone to do this with a shot from Marineland. I personally don''t think the photo is stellar, but the idea is what''s elevating big time. I chuckle quietly every time I scan through the thumb when I see this one, so it earned a better mark than the rest.', '2012-10-11 17:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6881190, 1036588, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2, tied with another.<br/>Another <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=112972" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">AllenP</a> entry. Really like this one as well. The juxtaposition of young and old works nicely. The lyric chosen wasn''t overly cliched like the majority of the entries.</td>', '#2, tied with another.Another  AllenP entry. Really like this one as well. The juxtaposition of young and old works nicely. The lyric chosen wasn''t overly cliched like the majority of the entries.', '2012-10-11 17:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6881192, 1036685, 144365, '<td valign="top">#3, tied with another.<br/>Gave this a higher vote simply because it was different. It''s a little underexposed, but you managed to take a photo of something random and find a Beatle''s lyric to fit the image. It could have been the other way around, but somehow I doubt it. It''s irrelevant in the end, I just liked the fact it was vastly different then the rest of the entries.</td>', '#3, tied with another.Gave this a higher vote simply because it was different. It''s a little underexposed, but you managed to take a photo of something random and find a Beatle''s lyric to fit the image. It could have been the other way around, but somehow I doubt it. It''s irrelevant in the end, I just liked the fact it was vastly different then the rest of the entries.', '2012-10-11 17:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6881194, 1036523, 144365, '<td valign="top">#3, tied with another. <br/>Obviously this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67152" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bassbone</a>. Similar style to your FS entry. I''m slightly biased towards good photos with runners in them, being one myself. I wish I could go back to these days of yore where running was my only stress.</td>', '#3, tied with another. Obviously this is  bassbone. Similar style to your FS entry. I''m slightly biased towards good photos with runners in them, being one myself. I wish I could go back to these days of yore where running was my only stress.', '2012-10-11 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
