(6883400, 1036651, 92577, '<td valign="top">The main feature of the picture is the water but the long exposure has rendered it soft and featureless. Check out <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=80831" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">wizardry</a> ''s moving water shots and you''ll see much shorter exposures but also plenty of movement and drama. (I know his are mostly waves but moving water is moving water.)</td>', 'The main feature of the picture is the water but the long exposure has rendered it soft and featureless. Check out  wizardry ''s moving water shots and you''ll see much shorter exposures but also plenty of movement and drama. (I know his are mostly waves but moving water is moving water.)', '2012-10-15 10:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
