(6883465, 1036651, 134859, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6.<br/> <br/>I thought it was a nice shot.  But as <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=92577" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hesitant</a> mentioned, it seemed a little too soft.  And the combination of the water moving and the clouds moving made my eyes not know what area to focus on.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'I gave it a 6. I thought it was a nice shot.  But as  hesitant mentioned, it seemed a little too soft.  And the combination of the water moving and the clouds moving made my eyes not know what area to focus on.   ', '2012-10-15 11:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
